Novelty 3 — Physics‑Decoded Digital Twin with Fleet‑Wide Federated Prognostic Transfer: First application of PD‑VNN to multi‑cycle cryogenic pressure‑vessel crack growth with FL‑based fleet learning, incorporating a formal adversarial threat model and byzantine‑robust aggregation.

